tierSelection.selectionAlgorithm:
tier = highestUnlockedCampaignWorld frozen at first opening for that Europe/Paris calendar day;
index = (wholeDaysSince2026_11_04 + tier*3) % 10 for dailyChallenges;
index = (wholeDaysSince2026_11_04 + tier*3 + 5) % 10 for dailyBugs;
select nth ascending worldLevel item in corresponding tier. A new tier becomes eligible next day.
